*=======================================================================
* SPICE Model Library for MESFET Transistors N and P Channel
* Created:  03/08/2026
* Author:   DSpice 
*=======================================================================


*-------------------------------------------------
* Ideal N-Channel MESFET
*-------------------------------------------------
.MODEL NMES NMF (
+ VTO=-2.0
+ BETA=0.05
+ LAMBDA=0.02
+ ALPHA=2
+ RD=1
+ RS=1
+ CGS=2p
+ CGD=0.5p
+ PB=1
+ IS=1e-14)

*-------------------------------------------------
* Ideal P-Channel MESFET
*-------------------------------------------------
.MODEL PMES PMF (
+ VTO=2.0
+ BETA=0.05
+ LAMBDA=0.02
+ ALPHA=2
+ RD=1
+ RS=1
+ CGS=2p
+ CGD=0.5p
+ PB=1
+ IS=1e-14)